1228:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return None
1229:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1230:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Description</b><br>
1231:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Writes data into the transmit FIFO. \n\n
1232:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The data provided is placed in the transmit FIFO.
1233:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The transmit FIFO should be configured before calling this API.
