1292:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * When the transmit FIFO filling level reaches the configured size, FIFO full flag is set.
1293:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * User should not write to the FIFO when the transmit FIFO is full.
